OL,3,GNEWSA'Cancer treatment plummeted me
OL,4,Ainto menopause'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Jo Menneer was diagnosed with
OL,7,Fbreast cancer, she knew undergoing
OL,8,Ftreatment would be a difficult process.
OL,9,FWhat she did not anticipate was the
OL,10,Fchallenge of navigating the menopause
OL,11,Fafterwards.
OL,13,FBefore her diagnosis in 2022, Jo, now
OL,14,F55, from East Yorkshire, had been
OL,15,Ftaking hormonal replacement therapy
OL,16,F(HRT) to manage the menopause.
OL,18,FPart of her treatment included surgery,
OL,19,Fwhich meant she had to stop taking HRT,
OL,20,Fand is still unable to use it.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
