OL,3,GNEWSA'Cancer treatment plummeted me
OL,4,Ainto menopause'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"For me personally, my menopause
OL,7,Fsymptoms came back with a vengeance
OL,8,Falmost immediately," she says.
